          "content": "<Project Sdk=\"Microsoft.NET.Sdk\">\n\n  <PropertyGroup>\n    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>\n    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>\n    <ImplicitUsings>enable</ImplicitUsings>\n  </PropertyGroup>\n\n</Project>\n",
